{"ts": 1784344537.6565301, "event": "finish", "summary": "Held the whole way -- the entry thesis never invalidated. Early dips to -6.5pts in the first few minutes recovered on strong bar closes (near-high clsInRng), and after that the trade trended firmly favorable, peaking around +42pts with only shallow pullbacks (giveback rarely exceeding ~40-50% of a small local leg amplitude, never threatening the entry). No sustained cluster of against-fires with deteriorating price ever appeared; against-fires were transient and always followed by recovery. Next time I'd watch for a pullback that both stacks multiple against-fires AND fails to reclaim a prior swing high/closes progressively weaker across several 1m bars -- that combination never showed up here, which is why this was a clean hold, not a bail.", "exit_frame": null, "n_commits": 48}
